//  - Precompute the composite coefficients (1 + 2*d) and (1 + 2*a) once.
//  - Use a single reciprocal per tridiagonal step instead of two divisions.
//  - Parallelize over independent i-lines (columns/rows) using OpenMP, while
//    keeping the j-recursions strictly sequential via noarr traversers.
//  - Use traverser range iteration for the outer i-dimension to keep all
//    loop nests in terms of noarr abstractions.
